1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Heat blowing cold?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The clue is in when it happens.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Cold at idle, better on the highway?

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
That can point to low coolant.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Never gets warm, no matter what?

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
That may indicate a stuck thermostat.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Warm air, then it clicks and goes cold?

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Worth checking the blend door.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Don't guess before winter hits.

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Nick's Tire & Auto — we check all three free. Link in bio.
